PROJECT_DIR=$(dirname "$0")
BLOG_TITLE="Skechou, and a new blog stylesheet"
BG="../assets/Screenshot from 2024-09-06 23-26-37.png"
BLOG_DATE="2026-11-21"
BLOG_DESC="A new Echostyle variant, and a new look for this blog!"
BLOG_TAGS="#devlog #stylesheet #echostyle"

init
source $PROJECT_DIR/src/extensions/blogpost.ibke
ptop

paragraph "ignore the background, i just chose a random screenshot that was sitting in my Pictures folder, but anyway:"
paragraph "i made a rushed, new variant of echostyle called <a href='https://kevadesu.github.io/echostyle/skechou'>Skechou!</a>"
paragraph "i'm also working on an internal side-project: IBKBB (Ibikei Blog Builder)! though, so far i haven't made much progress to make it usable in other repos with ibikei (i need to write documentation and an init function), but it's working pretty well!"
paragraph "from one command, i can make a new post (and edit it directly), delete posts, list them, edit them, compile them to HTML (using ibikei) and \"git add, commit and push\""
paragraph "also, big update from yesterday, i also managed to update the listing to actual items/cards instead of mere buttons, with date, description and tags :p"
paragraph "kevadesu out &#x270C;&#xFE0F;"

pbottom